    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετρ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like rock</i> or
				<i>stone, rocky, stony</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.
			κατῶρυξ</span>, of a grave, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				774
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; of ground, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεηρὰ καὶ πετρώδη καὶ ἄγρια</span>”
